1.9.12
Prevents players from leaving the upper/lower heights of the world.  Will teleport the player to void_location, or bed, or spawn.
- Applies feather falling and slowness for 3 seconds
- Added void_check to config.yml
- Added void_location to config.yml
Added support for Mangrove doors, gates, trapdoors, buttons, pressure plates
Added support for Tadpole buckets
Added voucher support
- Vouchers can be used to add additional volume or flags to a field
- The voucher key is saved in the field data, when loaded, these additions from the vouchers will be applied on top of the defaults
- If the voucher is removed from the Vouchers folder, the voucher does not load, and these additions can be removed
  - Benefits of this would be things like temporarily allowing players to enable healing effects inside their fields over a period of time
Cleanup
- Removed deprecated command functions
- Removed deprecated API calls from 1.9.11
- Removed deprecate Vault functions
- Removed unused functions
- Corrected documentation of API functions


